{
  "name": "Send new and pre-launch Shopify stores from Apify to a webhook daily",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send new and pre-launch Shopify stores from Apify to a webhook daily\n\nShopify app developers, agencies and service providers who want to reach new Shopify stores early, often while the store is still behind its password page.\n\n### How it works\n1. A **Schedule Trigger** runs every morning at 8.\n2. **Set your settings** holds your webhook URL, look-back window, status, countries and a cap on results.\n3. An **HTTP Request** runs the New Shopify Stores Pre-Launch Radar Actor on Apify and waits for its results. Stores come from public Certificate Transparency logs, DNS and each store's public metadata.\n4. **Keep store fields** keeps domain, name, status, niche, country, currency, product count and dates.\n5. A second **HTTP Request** posts each store to your webhook (Clay, Make, Slack, a CRM).\n\n### Setup\n1. Create an Apify account and copy your API token.\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`, and select it in the Apify node.\n3. Paste your webhook URL in **Set your settings**.\n4. Run once to test, then activate.\n\nAn Apify account (the Actor is billed per store returned, $0.02 each; `maxItems` caps every run) and an endpoint that accepts a JSON POST.\n\n### Customization\n- Set `status` to `pre-launch` to get only stores still behind a password page, or `live`.\n- Set `countries` to a list such as `US, GB, FR`; leave it empty for all.\n- Add or remove fields in **Keep store fields**.\n\nBusiness-level public data only: no emails, phones or personal names. Not affiliated with Shopify Inc. Disclosure: I built the Apify Actor used here.",
        "height": 1010,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "f7e7e8d1-5328-5846-b130-e939e44f4cbe",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Fetch new stores\nRuns daily, reads your settings and asks the Apify Actor for the stores first detected in the look-back window.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a13642cb-6757-521b-8372-692834b639b3",
      "name": "Fetch section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        20,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Deliver to your tools\nKeeps the useful fields and posts one JSON per store to your webhook.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b86a8892-7a9e-5fdf-ad4e-4a0f42eac267",
      "name": "Deliver section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "03df1928-fcf6-521f-8e90-96e70008196c",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        80,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "91dbe6d5-f901-5105-852c-81dc48bb7373",
              "name": "webhookUrl",
              "value": "https://example.com/your-webhook",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d86492de-8f25-56c0-802c-0b18c3e92b9e",
              "name": "sinceDays",
              "value": 1,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "824ab884-0d69-5586-9685-41d0c5e87c98",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "any",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0e61b955-c226-579a-9062-9fdb9905abef",
              "name": "countries",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fea52067-8229-5ac9-ba02-243fc8dc14dc",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1beff95-03cb-59a8-af18-ec022d4cf6a8",
      "name": "Set your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        300,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/prelaunch-radar~new-shopify-stores-pre-launch-radar/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ mode: 'feed', sinceDays: $json.sinceDays, status: $json.status, countries: $json.countries.split(',').map(c => c.trim().toUpperCase()).filter(c => c), maxItems: $json.maxItems }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "ab398d3c-6642-55fa-bb9a-c44e443c6598",
      "name": "Get new Shopify stores (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
